#. Crowdin string 491870
msgctxt "GroupSettings|Group URL can only contain letters, digits, underscores, periods, and dashes."
msgid "GroupSettings|Group URL can only contain letters, digits, underscores, periods, and dashes."
msgstr "Gruppens URL får endast innehålla bokstäver, siffror, understreck, punkter och bindestreck."

